{"t":"SAIL","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"SailPoint, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","employees":3229,"hq":"Austin, TX, United States","website":"https://www.sailpoint.com","summary_en":"SailPoint, Inc. delivers solutions to enable identity security for the enterprise in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia-Pacific, and internationally. Its solutions enable organizations to establish, control, and automate policies that help define and maintain a robust security posture and achieve regulatory compliance; and address various types of systems and identities, including data and applications, employee identities, non-employee identities, and machine identities, as well as enable smarter access decisions, improve business processes, and provide deeper understanding of identity and access. The company offers Identity Security Cloud, a cloud-based identity security solution to discover, manage, and secure all enterprise identity types, as well as the data and cloud infrastructure; and IdentityIQ, a customer-hosted identity security solution. It also provides SailPoint platform, a security platform engineered to unify identity, data, and security intelligence in real time. It serves financial services, media, energy and utilities, technology, life sciences, and healthcare, as well as government agencies and public universities. The company was founded in 2005 and is headquartered in Austin, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"SailPoint, Inc.는 미주, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카, 아시아 태평양 및 국제적으로 기업의 신원 보안을 지원하는 솔루션을 제공합니다. 해당 솔루션을 통해 조직은 강력한 보안 상태를 정의 및 유지하고 규정 준수를 달성하는 데 도움이 되는 정책을 수립, 제어 및 자동화할 수 있습니다. 데이터 및 애플리케이션, 직원 ID, 비직원 ID, 기계 ID를 포함한 다양한 유형의 시스템 및 ID를 처리할 뿐만 아니라 보다 스마트한 액세스 결정을 지원하고 비즈니스 프로세스를 개선하며 ID 및 액세스에 대한 더 깊은 이해를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 모든 기업 ID 유형은 물론 데이터 및 클라우드 인프라를 검색, 관리 및 보호하기 위한 클라우드 기반 ID 보안 솔루션인 Identity Security Cloud를 제공합니다. 고객이 호스팅하는 신원 보안 솔루션인 IdentityIQ도 있습니다. 또한 신원, 데이터, 보안 인텔리전스를 실시간으로 통합하도록 설계된 보안 플랫폼인 SailPoint 플랫폼도 제공합니다. 금융 서비스, 미디어, 에너지 및 유틸리티, 기술, 생명 과학, 의료는 물론 정부 기관과 공립 대학에도 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2005년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 오스틴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":22.01,"mcap":12565765120.0,"pe":null,"fpe":54.619453,"peg":1.7333,"ps":10.781031,"pb":1.8312671,"ev_ebitda":-1297.495,"div":0.0,"beta":null,"hi52":23.54,"lo52":10.3},"fin":{"rev":1165543936.0,"rev_g":0.168,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.66272,"op":-0.18854,"net":-0.16921,"roe":-0.02884,"fcf":339256640.0,"cash":309849984.0,"debt":31365000.0,"de":0.457,"eps":-0.35,"feps":0.40297},"own":{"short":0.3005,"inst":1.043,"insider":0.01727},"analyst":{"n":26,"mean":22.0,"median":22.0,"high":30.0,"low":10.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.81481,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":14,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":6,"buy":14,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":13,"hold":5,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":6,"buy":13,"hold":5,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-12","Firm":"Mizuho","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":20.0,"priorPriceTarget":19.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-09","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":27.0,"priorPriceTarget":25.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-08","Firm":"Amerx","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"","currentPriceTarget":0.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-08","Firm":"Baird","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":25.0,"priorPriceTarget":22.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-07","Firm":"Oppenheimer","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":30.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-05","Firm":"Scotiabank","ToGrade":"Sec